#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-future.rst:4
msgid ""
"The following APIs will be removed in the future, although there is "
"currently no date scheduled for their removal."
msgstr ""
"以下の API は将来削除されますが、現時点では削除時期は決まっていません。"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-future.rst:7
msgid ""
":mod:`argparse`: Nesting argument groups and nesting mutually exclusive "
"groups are deprecated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-future.rst:12
msgid ""
"Generators: ``throw(type, exc, tb)`` and ``athrow(type, exc, tb)`` signature "
"is deprecated: use ``throw(exc)`` and ``athrow(exc)`` instead, the single "
"argument signature."
msgstr ""
"ジェネレーター：``throw(type, exc, tb)`` と ``athrow(type, exc, tb)`` という"
"シグネチャは非推奨です。\n"
"代わりに、引数が一つの ``throw(exc)`` と ``athrow(exc)`` を使ってください。"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-future.rst:15
msgid ""
"Currently Python accepts numeric literals immediately followed by keywords, "
"for example ``0in x``, ``1or x``, ``0if 1else 2``.  It allows confusing and "
"ambiguous expressions like ``[0x1for x in y]`` (which can be interpreted as "
"``[0x1 for x in y]`` or ``[0x1f or x in y]``).  A syntax warning is raised "
"if the numeric literal is immediately followed by one of "
"keywords :keyword:`and`, :keyword:`else`, :keyword:`for`, :keyword:`if`, :keyword:`in`, :keyword:`is` "
"and :keyword:`or`.  In a future release it will be changed to a syntax "
"error. (:gh:`87999`)"
msgstr ""
"現在の Python は、``0in x``、``1or x``、``0if 1else 2`` のように数値リテラル"
"の直後にキーワードが続く記法を受け付けます。\n"
"そのため、``[0x1for x in y]`` のような紛らわしく曖昧な式も書けます (``[0x1 "
"for x in y]`` とも ``[0x1f or x in y]`` とも解釈できます)。\n"
"数値リテラルの直後"
"に :keyword:`and`、:keyword:`else`、:keyword:`for`、:keyword:`if`、:keyword:`in`、:keyword:`is`、:keyword:`or` "
"のいずれかが続く場合は、構文上の警告が発生します。\n"
"将来のリリースでは構文エラーになります。\n"
"(:gh:`87999`)"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-future.rst:23
